  m_text: '<b>NEXORA  -  COMPANY POLICIES</b>


    <b>Staff directory</b>

    Names, departments and phone extensions are on the directory board in the Lobby, beside the main door.


    <b>Lost & found</b>

    Found devices go in the FOUND DEVICES box in the corridor, outside the IT room.


    <b>Building hours</b>

    The floor locks at 6:30 PM for maintenance.'
